{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object visible, approach and take it. In order to process object, check weight, move and put down. Finally, scan area for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectWeight    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = PutObjectDown    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectApproached    />",
